---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Form Setu">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900">About Form Setu</h1>

  <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <p>Form Setu exists because filling a government exam form in India is harder than it should be. Every portal wants a photo at exact pixel dimensions and an exact file size, and getting it wrong means a rejected application.</p>

    <p>We do two things. We publish the exact photo, signature and document requirements for each exam, checked against the official notification. And we give you free tools to resize your files to match — working entirely inside your browser, so your documents never reach our servers.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">How we verify specifications</h2>
    <p>Every exam page shows the date we last checked it against the official notification. If we have not verified it, we do not publish it. When a notification changes, we update the page and the date.</p>
    <p>We are not perfect, and notifications change without warning. Always confirm against the official notification before you apply. Every exam page links to the official website.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">Independence</h2>
    <p>Form Setu is an independent website. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any government body, examination authority, or recruitment agency.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-lg font-bold text-navy-900">How we fund this</h2>
    <p>The tools are free and always will be. We may earn a small commission when you buy a recommended book through a link on this site, at no extra cost to you. That does not change what we recommend.</p>

    <p class="pt-2">Something wrong, or an exam you need added? <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-navy-700 underline">Get in touch</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>